// Binary Padding - Linux | T1027.001 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/linux/auditd/execve/lnx_auditd_binary_padding.yml
type:EXECVE AND ((*truncate* AND *\-s*) OR ((*dd* AND *if\=*) AND (NOT *of\=*)))

